{"seq":2,"slug":"the-welfare-model","title":"福利国家模式","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/influence-and-legacy/the-welfare-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pioneering-social-insurance","title":"开创社会保险","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/influence-and-legacy/the-welfare-model/pioneering-social-insurance","wordCount":1583,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-lasting-institution","title":"持久的制度","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/influence-and-legacy/the-welfare-model/a-lasting-institution","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 福利国家模式\n\n俾斯麦开创的福利国家，是他最受肯定的遗产。本章考察这一模式。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"开创社会保险\"——他世界首创的社会保险制度及其确立的国家责任。第二篇文档讲述\"持久的制度\",呈现这套历经百年、造福亿万民生的持久遗产。\n"}